    Q11 decided): system settings upstream.mise and upstream.rapid7
    through the helper's upstream ID on|off|refresh, which adds the
    maker's repository (key shipped in /usr/share/flickos-
    control/upstreams, fingerprint checked), pins it to its one package,
    adds its origin to automatic updates and installs the package; off
    removes both. Polkit action, History, postinst refresh; the Updates
    page still names its scope.

